  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds does not build every burrito the same way.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     You choose the size, tortilla, protein, rice, beans, cheese, vegetables, queso, guacamole, and finishing sauces. That means two Freebird Burritos can have completely different calories and macros even though they share the same entr\u00e9e name.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Freebirds Nutrition Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to build your order ingredient by ingredient and estimate the calories, protein, carbohydrates, fat, sodium, fiber, and other available nutrition values in the meal you actually order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.fg6qkcaz5349\">\n<span>\n     Burrito Size Is the First Big Decision\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds is known for offering burritos in several sizes rather than one standard portion.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Depending on the current menu and location, available sizes can include:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Halfbird\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebird\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Monster\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Super Monster\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Moving to a larger burrito can mean larger portions of the tortilla, protein, rice, beans, cheese, and other fillings.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For that reason, a Monster should not simply be calculated as a Freebird with a slightly larger tortilla.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The ingredient portions associated with the selected size need to be reflected throughout the calculation.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.z44952cbj273\">\n<span>\n     Do Not Treat \u201cFreebird Burrito\u201d as One Fixed Recipe\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This is the most important rule for Freebirds nutrition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A customer could build one Freebird Burrito with:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Flour tortilla + Spanish rice + black beans + Fajita White Chicken + cheese + pico\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     while another customer could order:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     High Protein tortilla + cauliflower rice + steak + refried beans + queso + guacamole + Creamy Jalape\u00f1o\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Both are technically Freebird Burritos, but their nutrition can differ substantially.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The calculator is most accurate when the entr\u00e9e acts as a container for your selected ingredients rather than assigning every Freebird Burrito one universal calorie number.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.uy9jispyycpq\">\n<span>\n     Tortilla Choice Can Change Calories, Carbs, and Protein\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds currently offers several tortilla options, including:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Flour\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Spicy Cayenne\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Garlic Herb\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Spinach\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     High Protein tortilla\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Soft corn tortillas are also available for tacos.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The High Protein tortilla is especially distinctive because Freebirds markets it with\n    </span>\n<span>\n     15g of protein\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver currently lists it at approximately\n    </span>\n<span>\n     250 calories, 15g protein, and 30g carbohydrates\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     By comparison, the current Flour Tortilla entry is approximately\n    </span>\n<span>\n     270 calories with 7g protein and 44g carbohydrates\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     So tortilla choice can change much more than flavor.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.jlowuqcyhay6\">\n<span>\n     Choose the Protein That Matches Your Order\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The current Freebirds menu includes proteins such as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Ranch Hand Steak\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Texas Ground Beef\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Fajita White Chicken\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds Chicken\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Carnitas\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and a vegetarian option that includes guacamole.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Current NutritionSolver values show useful differences between several individual protein portions:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<div>\n<div><div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 glass-card-static\"><table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Protein\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Calories\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Protein\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Freebirds Chicken\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         94\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         16g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Fajita White Chicken\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         97\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         18g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Carnitas\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         150\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         18g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Texas Ground Beef\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         169\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         14g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         Ranch Hand Steak\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         179\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 border-b border-zinc-800/50\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n         22g\n        </span>\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table></div></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The highest-calorie protein is not necessarily the highest-protein choice, so comparing both values can be more useful than looking at calories alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.bxeaiqwq9a1\">\n<span>\n     Rice Can Change the Bowl More Than Expected\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds currently offers:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Spanish Rice\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cilantro-Lime Rice\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cauliflower Rice\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The current NutritionSolver entries list approximately:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Spanish Rice:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     146 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cilantro-Lime Rice:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     167 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cauliflower Rice:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     40 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The cauliflower option has a very different carbohydrate profile from the traditional rice choices.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That makes rice selection particularly relevant for bowls and burritos where a substantial serving forms part of the base.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.d1uloiu9rxxp\">\n<span>\n     Black, Pinto, and Refried Beans Are Different\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds offers black beans, whole pinto beans, and refried beans.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Current NutritionSolver values show:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Beans:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     about 95 calories and 6g protein\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Pinto Beans:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     about 100 calories and 6g protein\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Refried Beans:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     about 172 calories and 8g protein\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Refried beans also have considerably more fat in the current data.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you change the bean selection, update the calculator instead of treating all beans as nutritionally interchangeable.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.r7mjlacd50gn\">\n<span>\n     Queso and Guacamole Deserve Separate Entries\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds allows queso and guacamole to be added to customized entr\u00e9es.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Current NutritionSolver entries list roughly:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Queso:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     98 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Guacamole:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     88 calories\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These are not insignificant additions when combined with cheese, rice, beans, meat, and sauces.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you order both queso and guacamole, include both.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The same applies to diced avocado if that is the option actually used in your meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.x3rpi36h1bsi\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds Gives You a Lot of Topping Freedom\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The current menu lets customers add multiple ingredients such as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Saut\u00e9ed peppers and onions\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Potatoes\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Monterey Jack cheese\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Roasted corn salsa\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Pico de gallo\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jalape\u00f1os\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Red onion\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Roasted garlic\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Lettuce\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Tortilla strips\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and other toppings.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Some add only a small number of calories, while cheese, potatoes, tortilla strips, avocado, and queso can make a more noticeable difference.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A proper Freebirds calculator should let the user add each selected topping instead of estimating an average amount for \u201ctoppings.\u201d\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.9dj4g47outbp\">\n<span>\n     \u201cThe Big Finish\u201d Can Include Up to Three Sauces\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sauce customization is another part of Freebirds that deserves its own nutrition logic.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The current menu offers finishing options such as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Agave Adobo Vinaigrette\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Fiery Habanero\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Creamy Jalape\u00f1o\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Death Sauce\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Roasted Tomatillo\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Spicy Tomatillo\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     House Roasted Salsa\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     BBQ Sauce\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Creamy Chipotle\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds Ranch\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sour Cream\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     and lime juice.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds allows customers to choose up to three finishing sauces.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That means someone using Creamy Jalape\u00f1o, Ranch, and sour cream can end up with a very different total from someone choosing tomatillo salsa and lime juice.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Current NutritionSolver data lists Creamy Jalape\u00f1o at about\n    </span>\n<span>\n     120 calories\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , compared with about\n    </span>\n<span>\n     15 calories for Death Sauce\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sauce choice can therefore make a real difference.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.41c0me26sl8v\">\n<span>\n     A Bowl Removes the Tortilla, Not the Other Ingredients\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Choosing a bowl instead of a burrito removes the large flour-style tortilla from the starting point.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     But it does not automatically create a low-calorie order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A bowl can still contain:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Rice + beans + steak + queso + cheese + guacamole + tortilla strips + creamy sauce\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     which can add up quickly.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Build the entire bowl before deciding how it compares with a burrito.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.97n8u217dwm8\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds Nachos Include Queso\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds nachos follow a different structure from a bowl or salad.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The current menu states that nachos include\n    </span>\n<span>\n     two scoops of Liquid Gold Queso on the side\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , in addition to the selected protein and customizable toppings.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That serving definition matters.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If the nutrition entry already includes those two queso portions, do not add them again. If you are assembling the nachos from components, make sure the queso is included.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.fgq5q2ntoc5n\">\n<span>\n     The Quesarito Needs Its Own Calculation\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds also offers the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Quesarito\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , which takes a burrito and fills it with melted queso before toasting it.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That makes it different from simply choosing a standard burrito and adding a small side of queso.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The Quesarito should ideally be available as its own build type:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Choose burrito size \u2192 add queso-filled preparation \u2192 choose remaining ingredients\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This gives users a more accurate result than estimating it from a normal burrito.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.mmxhaysqzsq9\">\n<span>\n     Power-Packed Bowls Are Fixed Combinations\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds currently offers several Power-Packed Bowls designed around specific combinations, including options positioned as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Keto\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Paleo\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Vegan/Vegetarian\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Unlike a fully customized bowl, these are preset recipes with defined ingredient combinations.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If NutritionSolver has verified nutrition for the complete current recipe, users should be able to select the preset bowl directly.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If they customize it, switch to ingredient-level calculation.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.89e42tm6mphu\">\n<span>\n     High-Protein Burritos Use a Different Starting Recipe\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds also currently promotes Protein-Packed Burritos using its High Protein tortilla and cauliflower rice.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Current combinations include steak, fajita chicken, and carnitas versions.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These meals have a distinct search intent because users may specifically be comparing protein rather than only calories.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Showing\n    </span>\n<span>\n     protein alongside calories\n    </span>\n<span>\n     is especially useful for these burritos.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.kyxwuyknfjkw\">\n<span>\n     Chips and Dip Need Portion Sizes\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The current menu offers chips with:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Queso\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Guacamole\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     House Roasted Salsa\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Corn Salsa\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Loaded Queso\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Creamy Jalape\u00f1o\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Several dips come in Regular and Large servings.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A large queso order should not use the nutrition value for a small entr\u00e9e topping portion.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver should preserve the serving context:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Entr\u00e9e portion\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Regular side\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Large side\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     so users do not accidentally undercount a shared appetizer.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.zboz3vh5mjeb\">\n<span>\n     Freebirds Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in a Freebirds burrito?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>What is the difference between Freebird and Monster burritos?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does Freebirds have a high-protein tortilla?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Is cauliflower rice lower in calories than regular rice?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does Freebirds queso add calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Can I use several Freebirds sauces?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.27i9zj13iy94\">\n<span>\n     Build Your Freebirds Order the Way You Actually Eat It\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Start with your exact\n    </span>\n<span>\n     entr\u00e9e and size\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , then choose the correct\n    </span>\n<span>\n     tortilla, rice, beans, protein, cheese, vegetables, queso, guacamole, and finishing sauces\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     After that, add any\n    </span>\n<span>\n     chips and dip, dessert, kids item, or beverage\n    </span>\n<span>\n     that is part of the order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That approach matches how Freebirds actually builds its food and gives you a much more useful nutrition total than relying on a single generic calorie number for a burrito.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "How many calories are in a Freebirds burrito?",
      "a": "There is no single calorie amount for every Freebirds burrito. Size, tortilla, protein, rice, beans, cheese, toppings, queso, guacamole, and finishing sauces all affect the final total."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is the difference between Freebird and Monster burritos?",
      "a": "Monster is a larger burrito format and generally uses larger ingredient portions. The exact nutrition depends on how each one is customized."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does Freebirds have a high-protein tortilla?",
      "a": "Yes. Freebirds currently offers a High Protein tortilla advertised with 15g of protein."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is cauliflower rice lower in calories than regular rice?",
      "a": "In the current NutritionSolver data, cauliflower rice is approximately 40 calories per listed serving, compared with 146 calories for Spanish rice and 167 for Cilantro-Lime rice."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does Freebirds queso add calories?",
      "a": "Yes. Queso has its own calories and macros and should be included whenever it is added to a burrito, bowl, tacos, nachos, or side order."
